        <mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#555A65&quot;&gt;Download, verify, wait for the running job, swap, restart, confirm; roll back automatically if the new runner does not come up. A running job is never killed; if the runner stays busy past the drain timeout the update is postponed (ADR 0002).&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1400" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
